[ti:Akken kan i d-ttaxreɣ]
[ar:Lounès Matoub]
[al:Yekkes-as i Znad Ucekkel]
[length:3:46]
[by:Rayane Kch]
[00:00.18] Akken kan i d-ttaxreɣ
[00:07.34] Tecɛel tmes deffir-iw
[00:13.92] Tcehdem s lbaṭel-nneɣ
[00:18.75] Tezzim-d aqus-is fell-i
[00:25.87] D aɣṛib waqil ara mmteɣ
[00:30.29] Tanṭelt-iw di lbeṛṛani
[00:33.70] A yemma yis-m i neddheɣ
[00:38.32] Ajenwi ad d-yettaẓ ɣur-i
[00:45.71] Tamurt-iw ur tt-ẓeṛṛeɣ
[00:50.90] Lfinga tegguni-yi
[00:56.50] Ɣef ayla nwen xudi ttnaɣeɣ
[01:01.52] Taggara tenṭlem-iyi
[01:07.81] Ɣliɣ ger tergi ḥeṣleɣ
[01:12.64] Ulac wi ara inadin fell-i
[01:16.07] D ṭṭlaba n medden i bubbeɣ
[01:20.93] Ansi akka tɛedda temẓi-w
[01:26.34]
[01:27.70] S lḥif tzerɛem-d anyir-iw
[01:32.46] Teggullem ur zziɣ s axxam
[01:38.86] Xulfeɣ i yemma lhemm-iw
[01:44.20] Tettraǧu ad yekkes ṭṭlam
[01:50.36] Ay iyi-ɣedṛen d iṛfiqen-iw
[01:54.67] Rran fell-i aɛdil n ṭṭlam
[01:58.66] Imi ttnaɣeɣ d yiman-iw
[02:02.53] Ad yeched yid-i leqlam
[02:10.18] Iɣeblan sdukleɣ-ten
[02:15.32] Aɛwaz yusa-d d amwanes
[02:21.85] A tamurt-iw ɛzizen
[02:27.86] Abrid ɣer ɣur-m yenxes
[02:34.64] D iṛfiqen-iw iyi-senzen
[02:38.83] Mi ara ruḥeɣ ad d-tezher tmes
[02:42.71] Ɣef lḥif cudden-iyi allen
[02:47.03] I wakken ad iyi-d-yessimes
[02:54.10] Akken kan i d-ttaxreɣ
[03:00.46] Tecɛel tmes deffir-iw
[03:06.59] Tcehdem s lbaṭel-nneɣ
[03:11.99] Tezzim-d aqus-is fell-i
[03:19.60] D aɣṛib waqil ara mmteɣ
[03:23.95] Tanṭelt-iw di lbeṛṛani
[03:27.83] A yemma yis-m i neddheɣ
[03:31.71] Ajenwi ad d-yettaẓ ɣur-i